schema-version 1

description "LLMNR off and resolv.conf pointed at the systemd-resolved stub"

targets "fedora" "rhel" "debian" "ubuntu"

// The `resolv.conf` link ships for Fedora and the deb family only. EL has no
// systemd-resolved. `deb/bootc-base` ships the same link, and the identical
// second rule changes nothing.
//
// The NetworkManager drop-in has no effect until a component such as
// `desktop-environment/kde-plasma` installs NetworkManager.
